---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Notice | Prodory" description="How AO Plus Solutions collects and uses enquiry details on the Prodory website, under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023." path="/legal/privacy/">
  <article class="wrap section !py-16 max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950">Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm muted">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">This notice explains what personal data the Prodory website collects, why, where it is kept, and your rights under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act).</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Who is responsible for your data</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">{SITE.parent} is the data fiduciary for the personal data described here. Prodory is a practice of {SITE.parent}.</p>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Address: {SITE.head.line1}, {SITE.head.line2}, {SITE.head.line3}.<br />Email: support@aoplus.in · Phone: {SITE.phone}<br />Grievance contact: grievance@aoplus.in</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">What we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">When you send an enquiry through this website we collect:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 grid list-disc gap-2 pl-5 text-slate-700">
      <li>your name, company (optional), work email and phone number (optional);</li>
      <li>the area of interest you choose and the requirement you describe;</li>
      <li>your consent choices: agreement to be contacted about your enquiry, and the optional marketing box;</li>
      <li>the page of this website you sent the enquiry from.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Your IP address is used only to limit repeated submissions from one network. It is not saved with your enquiry. This website does not record where you came from before arriving, and it does not record campaign tags.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Why we use it</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 grid list-disc gap-2 pl-5 text-slate-700">
      <li>To reply to your enquiry. This is based on your agreement when you tick the box “I agree that Prodory (AO Plus Solutions Pvt Ltd) may contact me about this enquiry”.</li>
      <li>To send cloud-native architecture guides and infrastructure updates. Only if you tick the optional marketing box. You can withdraw this at any time (see below).</li>
      <li>To protect the website from spam, through the rate limit and a bot check described below.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Where your data is kept</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Every enquiry is saved as a lead in the AO+ customer relationship system at crm.aoplus.in. If the CRM cannot be reached when you submit, the form shows you an error and asks you to email us, so the enquiry is not silently lost.</p>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">If you ticked the marketing box, your contact details are also stored in AO+'s marketing automation system. Contacts who did not tick the box are not added to it.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Who we share it with</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">We use these service providers to run the website and our business. Each processes data only on our instructions.</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 grid list-disc gap-2 pl-5 text-slate-700">
      <li><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> website hosting, the enquiry form function, and the bot check (Turnstile).</li>
      <li><strong>Calendly:</strong> if you book a call through our booking link.</li>
      <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> if you choose to message us on WhatsApp.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">This website does not use analytics or advertising cookies, and it loads no third-party fonts. The bot check on the enquiry form is provided by Cloudflare Turnstile, which may set a cookie to recognise your browser during that check.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">How long we keep it</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">We keep an enquiry record for as long as it is needed to respond to you and to keep a record of our dealings with you. When you withdraw marketing consent, we remove you from marketing communications. Where you ask us to erase your data, we do so unless we must keep it to meet a legal obligation.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Your rights</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Under the DPDP Act you can:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 grid list-disc gap-2 pl-5 text-slate-700">
      <li>ask for a summary of the personal data we hold about you;</li>
      <li>ask us to correct or update it;</li>
      <li>ask us to erase it, when it is no longer needed for the purpose it was collected for;</li>
      <li>withdraw your consent at any time. Withdrawing consent does not affect anything we did before you withdrew it;</li>
      <li>complain to our grievance officer, and then to the Data Protection Board of India if the grievance is not resolved. See the <a class="underline" href="/legal/grievance/">grievance redressal</a> page.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">To use these rights, email support@aoplus.in or grievance@aoplus.in, or call {SITE.phone}. We respond without undue delay.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">How to withdraw marketing consent</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Tell us by email or phone and we will stop sending marketing messages. Marketing emails also carry an unsubscribe link. Withdrawing marketing consent does not affect the handling of an enquiry you have already made.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Changes to this notice</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">We update this notice when our practices change. The date at the top shows when it was last changed.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
